{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_4_002_01",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:92f5643fdf7f0bae8066a8c7fb603a7146e2052749daae25d4cead580a1f32e6",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_01:1_4_002_01_a:cmd-000000:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d42ebc0681aba0211eefef91186f36befcf0dc75c9d1d25efe8ab1d2be857af7",
      "text": "始动，“男极！偶像联赛”",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_01:1_4_002_01_a:cmd-000000:synopsis:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e209373db03f1e96260245737effd2ee414a2bdcc9658258869067443c685a1a",
      "text": "在事务所举办的JIF庆功会结束，\n制作人与实、诚司、道夫、\n次郎、雨彦一同前往二次聚会。\n次日，送到参加二次聚会的成员手中的是……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_01:1_4_002_01_a:cmd-000012:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7824b3a8948acd2c72636875e79b09adab6d8fca3c20b65cfcfd68e8d3eae4ba",
      "text": "第1话",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_01:1_4_002_01_a:cmd-000012:title:001": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d42ebc0681aba0211eefef91186f36befcf0dc75c9d1d25efe8ab1d2be857af7",
      "text": "始动，“男极！偶像联赛”",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_01:1_4_002_01_a:cmd-000014:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:43a9f2e8da0a2b1741cae0c73c9a7877d3eada144074338dd35ac2b289672c27",
      "text": "JAPAN IDOL FES数日后……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_01:1_4_002_01_a:cmd-000016:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:923a338fc33696d70e084b02ec05ab501cf5c74c27bf2f12a87856d4ff0808e6",
      "text": "各位，庆功会辛苦了！\n明天的休息日请大家好好休息吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_01:1_4_002_01_a:cmd-000033:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ec3cef16830cb5dcdba1acd6b5f84d4cb119e6bd74489a60115a523cff398cd7",
      "text": "●●●●プロデューサー，\n我把垃圾集中收在这一边了。还有……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_01:1_4_002_01_a:cmd-000036:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:cac49aa6dcd9c8ca4fe157fd028c658cb3fece270c0c5389ae0947cad327bdad",
      "text": "贤君，你和大家一起回去也没关系的哦。\n收拾善后的事情交给我就好。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_01:1_4_002_01_a:cmd-000040:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:facebcce3baffe3908b79bb0f745eb2a711e48b530cc226f4b128beddaf597d5",
      "text": "不，我也来帮忙吧。\n我还有使不完的精力呢，就交给我吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_01:1_4_002_01_a:cmd-000053:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0dd4cb2bc5f14e0c25112f3dbbd1c06b8328235b126927c44337a9eca98fafae",
      "text": "（……毕竟JIF盛况空前呢。\n偶像们在整个庆功宴上也一直很开心）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_01:1_4_002_01_a:cmd-000055:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:364d9a3614b8aed82d6e7dc4957f31b8a254a955602bb95773da588462c34653",
      "text": "（所以，才会送来“那封信”吗）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_01:1_4_002_01_a:cmd-000069:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a3446b6d68a17c8104fce27a7fb01d0074b9a7eddb9f6f5fa91bf738f4da5c54",
      "text": "几个小时前……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_01:1_4_002_01_a:cmd-000074:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a33806006e0599272e7af805c5a5819187ede932e801297288dcdf36faca5d56",
      "text": "●●●●プロデューサー君，JIF辛苦了。\n那是充满激情的最棒舞台！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_01:1_4_002_01_a:cmd-000076:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6e985c53d304761027a89fef6e69ac21d18431a695e87453f82ddf6048e124ac",
      "text": "非常感谢！这份成功，\n完全归功于各位偶像的努力。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_01:1_4_002_01_a:cmd-000079:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:160061c3d2d3ebf53def69b803e9f51123493a33154992bcf65eeb3570cabf38",
      "text": "唔！今后我也十分期待你与偶像们的活跃！\n……话说回来。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_01:1_4_002_01_a:cmd-000082:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:216d7b76bf2774ed8ddcb6c108db6c6c21ceaee933fc4d4f3e82f5889f07b256",
      "text": "听说收到了一封奇妙的信件，\n这是真的吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_01:1_4_002_01_a:cmd-000084:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6cb7835d5cead77580cdc6b4624b7c33e802297749c81019f18c01f0d0c103e1",
      "text": "是的。JIF结束后，\nJupiter的三人在休息室里发现了这么个东西……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_01:1_4_002_01_b:cmd-000020:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4bfbc6bf009b5ba667b8a58e44350f55c51a45596b5fa22f1abdeaae9170a6b7",
      "text": "唔，这就是“那封信”吗……\n封面上写着“挑战书”呢。写着什么呢……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_01:1_4_002_01_b:cmd-000023:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d2ebc9018cc493d3c8e0c158ce1631fbf44c20d9bdfe1a34575a7e8ca8e76189",
      "text": "“立志成为顶尖偶像的人们啊。\n如今最接近顶点的，究竟是谁？”",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_01:1_4_002_01_b:cmd-000025:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:70de3352eb18d49247e6dbdd96cee3b4fc0dc180950288a09a1396ecbea44dd4",
      "text": "“如今最具实力的偶像事务所，\n究竟在何方？”",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_01:1_4_002_01_b:cmd-000027:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5f7a859c61ec9b6f52eba7a455049b2942d9a8e3f4e60b8df1f635099e51d9f1",
      "text": "“为了决出胜负，\n特此举办‘男极！偶像联赛’！”",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_01:1_4_002_01_b:cmd-000029:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f6a210594fcc1548f5b79457ec69c73b83e21a67177e81e158c624a04716ac96",
      "text": "“无论表现力部门还是体能部门，\n在形形色色的部门中尽管一较高下吧”",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_01:1_4_002_01_b:cmd-000031:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4f3ebc41c8cc93e6a8209bebe103d6a2a74ef903ff450c94363f4c094e290856",
      "text": "“优胜的唯一一家事务所，作为最接近顶点的存在，\n将获赐‘男极KING’的称号！”",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_01:1_4_002_01_b:cmd-000033:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:714a18cf800ed794f7a251381d289ab8c0421545a66c6f5e9614ee1d03d6e63f",
      "text": "“最近引起热议的新晋事务所，315 Production啊。\n静候尔等的挑战！”……原来如此。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_01:1_4_002_01_b:cmd-000035:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0cc8663950c5a5cbe7e0902022450acdc8dafa956c45a31ad44c0f510f98da2a",
      "text": "对以顶尖偶像为目标的他们而言，\n这正是一个检验自身实力的绝佳良机吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_01:1_4_002_01_b:cmd-000038:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e767b93f09cf9a095497e52100a5a72673b8c830868f1e28c297ad51c5c65d8b",
      "text": "那么……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_01:1_4_002_01_b:cmd-000043:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3899c6bd51248800b46171cc87a2133b0a2af64335339a682a3eac40f7b2a4b7",
      "text": "那还用说！这个什么“男极！偶像联赛”，\n我们欣然迎战！！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_01:1_4_002_01_b:cmd-000056:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:af73eb863e1daf8eb558fef83d53d59ef6d82cde9e80bcdf980a64c2356ffa7e",
      "text": "（总觉得变成不得了的大事了啊……）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_01:1_4_002_01_b:cmd-000069:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e635d3c02084a61660c71395075d7ae1a566219b239d1ab652a5327b534c1d61",
      "text": "喂——，●●●●プロデューサー酱。\n能耽误一下吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_01:1_4_002_01_c:cmd-000018:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:68d1bf6e482c482ec85edfc9ad932353504a11074e4aea233e8687f330afb56d",
      "text": "待会儿我们大叔组要去二次聚会，\n●●●●プロデューサー酱要不要也来？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_01:1_4_002_01_c:cmd-000023:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2462f1b5f668db29e82965612d9c5610890ba459c80e07d1a1cb6f67c2039a84",
      "text": "成员有渡边先生、信玄先生、\n硲先生和葛之叶哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_01:1_4_002_01_c:cmd-000026:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:de69a1679da28e30c1ba4ef22d9b7efd438e92bc6a75545d13e8ef366037a793",
      "text": "二次聚会的店现在\n渡边先生正在找，不过……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_01:1_4_002_01_c:cmd-000033:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:fb99c4ea18b4dafb946fb2d8693064063e901bbcf2203fe314269e45fe44dd49",
      "text": "制作人似乎一直惦记着这个，\n根本顾不上这些呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_01:1_4_002_01_c:cmd-000041:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:50a71b38646396183cd5d5578ebfea9ca630ecb32a9f25d46217390c62dc0795",
      "text": "这个……？啊，这封“挑战书”啊。\n好像是叫男极联赛？的偶像大赛来着。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_01:1_4_002_01_c:cmd-000044:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:79181a1f707a5a62028773e45fd7503f9c86b39ee203cb01cd5266df93f54c62",
      "text": "偶像界经常会冒出这种活动，\n真是有趣啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_01:1_4_002_01_c:cmd-000048:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b9209b39a6d7a9f9f5b2008dbeae38a5e99b5f8242e60ae5771edcc085913afb",
      "text": "收到挑战书这种活动，\n按理说再怎么说也不常见就是了……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_01:1_4_002_01_c:cmd-000055:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b290bc21945175c1ae55897c39803184ee908af019853d2dec596096fd4b30a1",
      "text": "最先发现这个的Jupiter，\n还干劲十足地说“由我们来打头阵！”呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_01:1_4_002_01_c:cmd-000059:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:15fad34e93ed879b687007b1ad80731b86db6e165beb960509a8ee3874c5fec9",
      "text": "哎呀，年轻真是有冲劲，真好啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_01:1_4_002_01_c:cmd-000069:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a0dc76f8de66517c75787b8d8f5bf18dc028d68c3a6c59dba8746d506076aace",
      "text": "不过，听说第一战是“受欢迎部门”的时候，\n天濑动摇得很明显啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_01:1_4_002_01_c:cmd-000074:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:912ab9fa9393efd60fbc14e5642590a6218c41f56fe625ae289b35acbcced6b7",
      "text": "庆功宴上也在热火朝天地开作战会议。\n真是让人忍俊不禁。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_01:1_4_002_01_c:cmd-000077:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:dd4fd9ff0b8f9db4682b57cbfcd2da0aa86278c29e83dc3fdc42e48392cc5a00",
      "text": "……那个，次郎先生、雨彦先生。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_01:1_4_002_01_d:cmd-000017:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d41125dca84a51341c1b9ce628a53a7a8d553abeeb079f6579d40a35e6498412",
      "text": "突然收到“挑战书”，\n两位没有感到动摇吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_01:1_4_002_01_d:cmd-000022:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5154620bc0d5eb7dbaa36c0bfe121c3376b9cd3835b481b799f47b0ad4c60db4",
      "text": "嗯——，毕竟都是大叔了嘛。\n区区这点小事还不至于动摇啦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_01:1_4_002_01_d:cmd-000027:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f63e0ee53e1019e44c9621f30ed759c401ddfb84e24460b42ef3a9772068cf4b",
      "text": "是啊，虽说也有上了年纪的缘故……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_01:1_4_002_01_d:cmd-000034:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4e125f460915661c8f520ad058f1be9bb4329be647c76aa1506f0470a651b70e",
      "text": "不过待在这家事务所里，\n每天尽是些新鲜事呢。早就习惯了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_01:1_4_002_01_d:cmd-000039:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2f57e2a0a0d16324c558b57a4d63a4e24156f812a59b67bcf5f5f51c968c6398",
      "text": "况且托JIF的福，\n所有人作为偶像应该都积累了很棒的经验。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_01:1_4_002_01_d:cmd-000043:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2626a049e5cb6c06715e07748f666c3945f54da56fe6b92c44ab2d04c3e64baf",
      "text": "这次肯定也能挺过去的。\n毕竟还有你在嘛。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_01:1_4_002_01_d:cmd-000052:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:006c625c542acad31b4d7a941f4ad875edfe693c266fb3b8bddd1f37ef6130fa",
      "text": "没错没错，只要大家都在这次也没问题！\n所以，现在二次聚会才是最优先的！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_01:1_4_002_01_d:cmd-000057:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1d88b093523acd5e8b9f2fe4b011612036539820218173bb4ac93cfbb4387270",
      "text": "得好好慰劳一下彼此的辛劳呢。……所以说，\n●●●●プロデューサー酱也来二次聚会对吧？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_01:1_4_002_01_d:cmd-000061:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7b1d93a6e88aba2d0987ebbccbcc02c710c1b6953eaa24d6e95e1f404a4a000f",
      "text": "谢谢大家。请让我参加！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_01:1_4_002_01_d:cmd-000065:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a833a206e2f50ce8a3e611acd72516a4c5159a0a8c2309ac84c176f12d0c734c",
      "text": "好，那就这么定了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_01:1_4_002_01_d:cmd-000070:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:18120e5644b4f63950f7272171c457bb9c8f501de5f41805eed33518d4d4b991",
      "text": "那么，剩下的清理工作就赶快利落地搞定吧！\n我们也会帮忙的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_01:1_4_002_01_d:cmd-000085:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2cf299b9db82240fc03c5e3aeca137dae387b6b9aadfc396c17215c632e680b3",
      "text": "数十分钟后……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_01:1_4_002_01_d:cmd-000095:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0917752c90f25564de67dcb4a3082723806cb285765e1662659ae068b6a60a7c",
      "text": "●●●●プロデューサー，\n二次聚会的店找到了哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_01:1_4_002_01_d:cmd-000097:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4d59902440f7d96de35393019658bd4d7c894c1ad49e965e53622630f0c23e08",
      "text": "我先过去了，\n收拾完之后大家一起过来好吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_01:1_4_002_01_d:cmd-000099:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a32bb67aaaab94082f94bea8bb59e59213d83cb622de5c46b1bd42c3f21ec28f",
      "text": "地点我发消息给你。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_01:1_4_002_01_d:cmd-000101:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2d53f13713330cf0c369a1dec6809f1385be8b229b30862101923e9e01917021",
      "text": "关于男极的事情…",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_01:1_4_002_01_d:cmd-000103:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e5ffcd6f585184228b6e8a7f5400794956bf7a493dcd9d9dfef350be8f863e9c",
      "text": "难道是，挑战书的事？\n我当然也有一些想法啦……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_01:1_4_002_01_d:cmd-000105:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9012d9e237878c3e06c6644145ceb593b3103c90a7bce1e2fb9c1657e283c4e4",
      "text": "但比起那个，现在好好慰劳\n●●●●プロデューサー才是最重要的哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_01:1_4_002_01_d:cmd-000107:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4afb89f3caf06c291bb11a759fc50a2de51ec6d9ad3349b8bad026cf68b4d3d0",
      "text": "我也会好好慰劳大家的",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_01:1_4_002_01_d:cmd-000109:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d29fae445edeb0f003a9a35dcf8bdf98c086d747a47622e284f1fb1a0144da3a",
      "text": "啊哈哈，我就知道你会这么说。\n那我们就互相慰劳，尽情享受二次聚会吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_01:1_4_002_01_d:cmd-000111:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:922bd43caac8247d739784595e50997a8a035e5b85f16087f3bb9c8a3d013ba4",
      "text": "啊，到店里了。\n我先进去在座位上等你们哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_01:1_4_002_01_d:cmd-000113:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b317823ef29a55275b1f56fe8eddab812debe393ba15e7394e483094e9eda71d",
      "text": "待会儿再慢慢聊。先这样啦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_01:1_4_002_01_e:cmd-000011:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:de032b14ad770092a08e64ee0b7359b1bdf150548e5d96e8eacb1487cc8ae481",
      "text": "次日……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_01:1_4_002_01_e:cmd-000022:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4f8e4c5bfb7d232b0a35012d89b08af538621b21d93631eb9273a3e4b36a8ac5",
      "text": "呼……呼……嗯…………？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_01:1_4_002_01_e:cmd-000032:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6060b148ea5d3bbb3618afef97c5177fa59e3951414c3c9018bb3167855b7ed0",
      "text": "（啧，感觉到有人的气息……在玄关吗）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_01:1_4_002_01_e:cmd-000038:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2a3235e07267e90678425f9fbd7452cb80f43ee500fd6c48fd2165bbeea496e3",
      "text": "（从脚步声推测……恐怕不是妹妹\n或者制作人……是谁？）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_01:1_4_002_01_e:cmd-000054:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:33a089b27f03175151a57fef5aa05dd329f0187660058c7e306b506322078c2b",
      "text": "噗溜！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_01:1_4_002_01_e:cmd-000067:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:21903f5b6f125355842dfec8602d874a95301aba93eaa0d481e4827832128850",
      "text": "这是……玩具箭？\n为什么墙上会有这种东西……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_01:1_4_002_01_e:cmd-000081:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5a17eeb7582cc86008db9a32affd047ea01f01f924fff1d8aaf31a5d0e9caa44",
      "text": "（箭上绑着什么东西啊。\n……信？到底是谁把这种东西……）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_01:1_4_002_01_e:cmd-000094:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9d3b085e5b73266089d7563fbb32fbf7d6e617d76b24777d57c75037bfc9a49f",
      "text": "这、这是……！？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_01:1_4_002_01_f:cmd-000022:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d97839694a88d3dbaae2835aa42718463b83dd8670118274c73ca9eac5ddd44c",
      "text": "事务所",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_01:1_4_002_01_f:cmd-000028:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:64abcda397e8b77e566b3abc0ee5569df237185fd6035ca25707f5c27c31bf89",
      "text": "……事情就是这样。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_01:1_4_002_01_f:cmd-000030:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0bcb49e7fce7028a7ebc470b87410ff950406561bdb14c9d2e3ea6301a729a7c",
      "text": "居然有这种事……\n而且大家也都收到了同样的信。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_01:1_4_002_01_f:cmd-000040:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e6937a0dcf11ca9cb8fa31f7316f44856dd45f63f3b57b9e0a3d83696dbccb8a",
      "text": "我是在散步时，被黑衣男子当面递交的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_01:1_4_002_01_f:cmd-000044:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d7103f11cfcbd05fb86af442085ba367249b946711df0b2758baad025acea54b",
      "text": "我的话，是夹在掉在路边的赛马杂志里哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_01:1_4_002_01_f:cmd-000050:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ab6f3306bb25b8feff00d6fc097b5342208a59f0d823b7271f2b894a8144ee2a",
      "text": "我家则是从窗户飞进了一只纸飞机。\n还真是古风的递交方式啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_01:1_4_002_01_f:cmd-000063:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:76b1a746ed8879db15c7a7a2b540abeb28444e0b9a5c28ad23bad09456511e93",
      "text": "从信的内容与字迹推断，恐怕寄信人和\n之前给我们送来挑战书的是同一人。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_01:1_4_002_01_f:cmd-000071:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9ab82257d1b3fa864120ff6d2e1537dcd487fc325c4f5a584c1fe07226227d1e",
      "text": "“态度真是游刃有余啊，\n315 Production！”",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_01:1_4_002_01_f:cmd-000073:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:00f3539771eed6c0eba6d2c899011db59cfbada81040de3957d326e02680a41b",
      "text": "“在男极可就不会这样了。定要全力将你们\n打得落花流水，洗干净脖子等着吧！”",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_01:1_4_002_01_f:cmd-000076:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:84318faeaf5928bb551656dc2f81fedd17f2f7f7e41fb9b824b16dc2dafa0ccc",
      "text": "……每一封信上，都写着这些内容。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_01:1_4_002_01_f:cmd-000088:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1564773ccfff832d3706f20b77dd19c63bb3da958f2103f5150109ec85051e26",
      "text": "游刃有余……\n难不成，是指昨晚的事？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_01:1_4_002_01_g:cmd-000027:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:fc1e388a20f1be1c01ae82da4e376c4b83a5413acaf88c05814963edcba42f9d",
      "text": "二次聚会后……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_01:1_4_002_01_g:cmd-000035:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4da8a1a106276b47266bfd31fc7659b282828ed6e48614d65afef4fbd5a5977a",
      "text": "再次向大家说一声，JAPAN IDOL FES辛苦了！\n……话说，这都是第几次说了啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_01:1_4_002_01_g:cmd-000044:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5e92c679b44ebf1823df1d74fab016bbc4fa7c728b21575e7150bcafeafe5457",
      "text": "虽然我家里窄了点有点不好意思，但为了好好慰劳\n大家的奋战，接着享受三次聚会吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_01:1_4_002_01_g:cmd-000070:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:835e259d586a3e8c41754723ba555b83374b1a238f0b5535308202003fa19f24",
      "text": "干杯！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_01:1_4_002_01_g:cmd-000100:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:cd0a728d6234b5a6de5eb7eab270c49f2aa88a9d61d1a154e804528a5edcde59",
      "text": "……咕～，好喝！一想到明天休假就\n更好喝了！来，葛之叶你也喝啊喝啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_01:1_4_002_01_g:cmd-000106:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a4d71c89aeeec3c7dfd601da7fd864b4e688eeaf447508d7ba641616759200df",
      "text": "承蒙款待了，山下先生。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_01:1_4_002_01_g:cmd-000124:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b599c4b7eba1cf6ad03d6b4085ed47689308eb386c4158cf6d3beea7943fec7d",
      "text": "哈啊……我们竟然能登上新人偶像的龙门——JIF，\n而且还能把现场气氛炒得那么热烈……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_01:1_4_002_01_g:cmd-000129:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:276e3e62138d10d5316edf7208eea1fa370f724360a5b6fe26bb236ae1037724",
      "text": "那份热烈的盛况，坦白说也远远超出了\n我的预想。渡边君会激动得说不出话也是理所当然的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_01:1_4_002_01_g:cmd-000131:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:bec741d9265e031516ee99f0357f0214185ed316de95158475892a54d5cb121e",
      "text": "这是因为大家为了JIF，\n全心全意不断努力付出的结果哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_01:1_4_002_01_g:cmd-000139:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9c6b1769aef361095b85007cfd81707a8da30e7ae160d888eebd372d7a2218c7",
      "text": "这样啊，确实呢……真高兴啊。\n希望能乘着这股势头，连结到下一次机会呢！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_01:1_4_002_01_g:cmd-000145:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:91a7c0d7bea7a1eb39b3d8f8fb4ccd438deb160fa6de962b54b7b4c0a3fdd396",
      "text": "嗯。说到下一个目标，\n应该就是“男极！偶像联赛”了吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_01:1_4_002_01_h:cmd-000027:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:609136aff4c0540e2f5c12365c7121ae770987ee7d5830720abb19ff37d40528",
      "text": "315 Production全员都干劲十足，\n誓要“一定要拿下第一名”。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_01:1_4_002_01_h:cmd-000043:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:327806631df030376ee645d8835bfba3ad3f1ba3d8ba5ba6dafa1a56d93c41f0",
      "text": "听说男极会有各种事务所参加，\n但第一名当然想由我们拿下啊！对吧，雨彦！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_01:1_4_002_01_h:cmd-000053:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8c42fc09a7613a96347c6dfc24f5922d4ba4b49cf74036e7546d69449aa12fb3",
      "text": "哈哈。既然年长的渡边先生都这么说了，\n我也只能点头赞同了吧？山下先生。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_01:1_4_002_01_h:cmd-000062:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8d1fd8db10e0ca7f76acc3101a0ab637a895425172377df26491a3c08e4b0aa5",
      "text": "哎呀，就因为我们同龄就把球踢给我吗？\n哎……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_01:1_4_002_01_h:cmd-000069:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:19ea16bcb58bd8d7b5f9c535cdc9b12bed83f4b2295e7638a15dc6a64a2ea593",
      "text": "虽然光靠我自己一个人完全没把握。但和大家在一起，\n就觉得下次好像也能取得不错的成绩呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_01:1_4_002_01_h:cmd-000083:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:20797f91da8cacfeed87c8dbad203762720733f8555d7441d6a885d98a64fc3a",
      "text": "嗯。我们有许许多多的伙伴，\n而且还有●●●●プロデューサー在。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_01:1_4_002_01_h:cmd-000097:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f76bfd5f77567a4f3b36f43351994a715a43ba287ff405dbce05c84afdca0474",
      "text": "没错，只要有我们和制作人在就没问题！\n315 Production，最棒了！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_01:1_4_002_01_h:cmd-000130:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d7080e95e24377bfbd190bb8abd380de5cc711cdfd8e0d98de04d4b2b496591a",
      "text": "最棒！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_01:1_4_002_01_h:cmd-000149:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:395e1e0587dd4b9f9651c99d8688715f896c700b3636d0c7194d15a0e800904d",
      "text": "…………",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_01:1_4_002_01_i:cmd-000032:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f750b2be49b6e6e82cf923107ff566903b710fd56b5a3248222d777b62f541d4",
      "text": "……、……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_01:1_4_002_01_i:cmd-000041:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:937f819207a70bac15cfe5a2e1f67c70cae30d6df2cf68db5d0016d0454fd514",
      "text": "唔……\n那帮家伙居然说了那样的话吗……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_01:1_4_002_01_i:cmd-000046:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:80d103e2f2852a174d940f9a02468285722d6995c6d4b5582db0522c924e46bb",
      "text": "区区一家新面孔事务所，居然这么狂妄！\n我一定要让他们好看！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_01:1_4_002_01_i:cmd-000066:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:69526c674c9fd0ca8f0909da2ddab4b2cb601cd8af9507c478f7ca2d1ca7c950",
      "text": "总而言之，就是男极的相关人士\n听到了那些话对吧？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_01:1_4_002_01_i:cmd-000072:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f1d6e288555ccde605f8f10fdfc637f016ffbba5f0c3f3d0631781dffb5afaa3",
      "text": "应该就是这么回事吧。\n毕竟信玄先生家里都收到信了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_01:1_4_002_01_i:cmd-000082:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:db8a3a44ea5ca762a389e60bebc3a0be3fec6146fb0584791db5e871cb603e64",
      "text": "……可能是因为情绪太亢奋，\n声音变得有些大了吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_01:1_4_002_01_i:cmd-000086:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e5ef9b730020c78e8ae9943f2ef9877cbd415e6c231f195b173ac822836c36e3",
      "text": "应该更加注意一些的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_01:1_4_002_01_i:cmd-000089:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2d1e36f21162d90bfa5d34dede1a96b7c586d9c096eb7bb1ecc35b18f82dda4f",
      "text": "我也因为是在自己家里，\n好像有点太得意忘形了……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_01:1_4_002_01_i:cmd-000103:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f7c87f3ecd0ec6267f26e07b764c02c705f1f9d7e692f30a53807906c1c4426e",
      "text": "……不过，多亏如此，我反而更加燃起来了！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_01:1_4_002_01_i:cmd-000105:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:bd213b5293136bba1ab29447f9b18c51eae288b1c2c402f01d2ab942378fd009",
      "text": "诶……实先生？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_01:1_4_002_01_j:cmd-000031:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a6c5e651a8d752635095b18a40b79e6400d220982644ec5fca9a77b886a9e3a4",
      "text": "我也收到了同样的信哦。\n所以就急忙赶来事务所了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_01:1_4_002_01_j:cmd-000033:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a83604bcc2a80f4311ab5c6feeb8422d0e5d5c8b4dbcfd91b78fb1720c9ad9c0",
      "text": "原来是这样啊！\n……咦？停在实先生肩膀上的是？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_01:1_4_002_01_j:cmd-000039:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0836c6d9698f0183b23fedd0570038f28198ab09235a249cb31b7799d855caab",
      "text": "是鸽子哦。\n我家的信是这孩子送来的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_01:1_4_002_01_j:cmd-000042:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3579d21bf52fc3ff39bc9a2c5027afaaa0bf116b6741dc8465b2e742cd76e80a",
      "text": "咕噜噜——！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_01:1_4_002_01_j:cmd-000047:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9e1e9c37de7d94158bbf3bded0bea0a271e6a4dbe035b6e846b2c660be091a96",
      "text": "乖哦乖哦。……大概是男极那边的鸽子吧，\n不过看样子已经彻底成为我的粉丝了呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_01:1_4_002_01_j:cmd-000053:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1c5084c198941b130ef0ce22d370c6768d9471aada33c0d6fc30c97b9c0c63d6",
      "text": "呵呵呵……面对这种挑战，\n身为男子汉怎么可能不热血沸腾呢！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_01:1_4_002_01_j:cmd-000057:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:725044797536026fefc2109a4509a5c51706e1b945bbc86b01eb6751a520b89f",
      "text": "正合我意，就跟他们真刀真枪地干一场吧！！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_01:1_4_002_01_j:cmd-000065:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f0d528aac5aef8972705c191956f2b4c8c0fa81e1336519035431b55340ecd2f",
      "text": "哈哈。挺有活力嘛，渡边先生。\n连我都觉得心态要变年轻了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_01:1_4_002_01_j:cmd-000073:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e3c309aed6ed3105746147c063671cf594871e215f94b6170034e7c42180b1a5",
      "text": "就算变年轻了，真刀真枪这种词，\n我可说不太出口啊……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_01:1_4_002_01_j:cmd-000079:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d2997ea87722cf2bee664a64173dbf14084a7b8429c71bc59ceb8d2eb6066375",
      "text": "不，哎，正因如此，\n说不定反而是重拾热血青春的机会？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_01:1_4_002_01_j:cmd-000088:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:31fbec3ea2775728085b190dbd2ad3b546f2dd2e284268922f3d6c89f566e4ec",
      "text": "嗯。喜庆的气氛就到昨天为止了，山下君。\n一起朝着男极第一的目标奔跑吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_01:1_4_002_01_j:cmd-000096:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:107cf1243a37c3027a1fb8de07d6fd3afb9b065ace221c254b156aa71cbc22bf",
      "text": "既然决定了，\n我这就去制定训练菜单！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_01:1_4_002_01_j:cmd-000101:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a63e24fe2ff64a8b373fa31d46cd01427ca7905865cb08f4e6048b74801ea1da",
      "text": "我一定会把大家的气力与体力充分锻炼出来的，\n交给我吧，●●●●プロデューサー！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_01:1_4_002_01_j:cmd-000106:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:033f7be18e9b9ff324ace80a37fa8967638f1712dc09a7bd36147111ac821d43",
      "text": "就拜托你了！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_01:1_4_002_01_j:cmd-000106:choice_detail:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:da7e2d4b40b63f98e9fc566d7b5145da923c16c638a22c9f1885bf030e4dc72a",
      "text": "appeal",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_01:1_4_002_01_j:cmd-000116:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:84ae730b84ebef438a4c70372062783707ecf360949e3c7ad6ebe39821ff138d",
      "text": "好嘞，大家！\n一起拿下“男极KING”吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_01:1_4_002_01_j:cmd-000154:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0522f5feb089c6d0ce8700a3a14d006211d88ef37bf2eed6509b13d9b6b2b377",
      "text": "哦——！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_01:1_4_002_01_j:cmd-000172:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d754b865bcb97c6ac4d1751a7324118e65611b0ee124791cbf4f7dff6d44926c",
      "text": "数小时后……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_01:1_4_002_01_j:cmd-000182:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5fe176c7d7536e2d7cb9ef506ccfde4a99b6b068d364e3b7e1417ecfc94034f8",
      "text": "喂，●●●●プロデューサー。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_01:1_4_002_01_j:cmd-000184:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:cc5aea847be026a7fdb170214370b3ba1b5085263411cca2921ed1df04bdf72d",
      "text": "今天我和实先生他们马上就开始了\n训练。现在正在休息。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_01:1_4_002_01_j:cmd-000186:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:04d6f993ab17f53498f43924b1a5c95a8860637e0658276c460c526a6d696657",
      "text": "虽然是结合了各自的课题制定的\n特训菜单……但总之非常开心。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_01:1_4_002_01_j:cmd-000188:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a0921c73aa279618322c95995831b3fb53376eed373ac392656fe73421643c30",
      "text": "简直就像同龄人在参加社团活动一样。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_01:1_4_002_01_j:cmd-000190:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1e41a325720f3e33ee2f5ef59b62007dcf50de7b88d217087db5c1be654ba377",
      "text": "训练\n请加油！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_01:1_4_002_01_j:cmd-000192:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ed5874e8dad3cbcd1876dbdc172be6bf4bcde0cf2e8432b3b41442120d5ffad8",
      "text": "嗯，交给我吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_01:1_4_002_01_j:cmd-000194:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c4d7510bacfa6259dd624a56c7c34a9c80c4a5bac233925cb6948ee6cb074283",
      "text": "●●●●プロデューサー要是抽得出时间，\n也来看看我们吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_01:1_4_002_01_j:cmd-000196:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0e1569a83254bc819e90a68ccec5bf3707c3c06eea4112f589fa58ea83011b74",
      "text": "大家一定也会很高兴的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_01:1_4_002_01_j:cmd-000199:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7c6ba9cc35efb5a83d26e69cd5c4b4e5a67cfdd323e943f77ed829712deb7db0",
      "text": "……啊，差不多该进行下一项训练了。\n那就先这样，●●●●プロデューサー。回聊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_01:1_4_002_01_j:cmd-000201:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:bc6f79861cae08877ddecff22f9a676a19878e1c080ba24102894e5de5b3976a",
      "text": "各位，休息时间结束了！\n开始下一项特训吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
